イェーイ！いっぱいい聞いてね！聞いてください！
Yay! Please listen to it a lot! Please listen!

627
00:43:04,064 --> 00:43:09,064
ということで、本当に念願の、マジでね、もう年単位でさ。
So, this has truly been our long-cherished wish, literally taking years.

628
00:43:09,064 --> 00:43:13,064
ね、企画書書いたりとかさ、本当にいっぱいしゃべって準備してきまして。
Right, writing proposal documents and talking a lot to prepare.

629
00:43:13,064 --> 00:43:20,064
けれどさ、ね、3Dライブ念願叶えられましたね！叶いましたね！やったね！この日が来たね！
But you know, we were finally able to fulfill our dream of a 3D live! We did it! Yay! This day has finally come!

630
00:43:22,064 --> 00:43:26,064
ということで、僕ら2人に手紙を書いてきちゃいました！
And so, I wrote letters to you two!

631
00:43:26,564 --> 00:43:29,564
え？え？聞いてません、社長。
Huh? What? We didn't hear about this, Boss.

632
00:43:29,564 --> 00:43:33,064
え、サプライズで読んでくれるんですか？どういう手紙なんだ？
Oh, are you reading it as a surprise? What kind of letter is it?

633
00:43:34,064 --> 00:43:38,064
まじめなやつをね。まじめなやつって言うな！
A serious one. Don't call it a serious one!

634
00:43:38,064 --> 00:43:40,064
って言いながらじゃなくて。それでは、AZちゃんへ。
Instead of saying that... Now then, to AZ-chan.

635
00:43:41,064 --> 00:43:56,064
かなけんに入ってくれて本当にありがとう。AZちゃんがそせんしてコラボの案を出してくれたり、かなけんでのオリジナル曲MVを進行してくれたり、本当に助かりました。
Thank you so much for joining Kanaken. AZ-chan took the initiative to propose collaborations, and pushed forward with Kanaken's original song MV, which really helped us out.

636
00:43:56,064 --> 00:44:01,064
またAZちゃんへの信頼がどんどんあまりに熱くなりまくりました。
My trust in AZ-chan has grown stronger and hotter than ever.

637
00:44:01,064 --> 00:44:07,064
本当に手伝ってくれてありがとうございます。本当に支えでき...
Thank you so much for helping out. Really supporting...

638
00:44:08,064 --> 00:44:20,064
AZちゃんとかねけんはでの活動のこと考えて交わすLINEはめちゃめちゃ楽しいし、一緒に音楽について話すのも最高の幸せです。
Exchanging texts thinking about activities with AZ-chan and Kanaken is super fun, and talking about music together is the ultimate happiness.

639
00:44:20,064 --> 00:44:26,064
AZちゃんとう出会えて本当によかったです。これからもたくさんしゃべろうね！ありがとう。
I'm so glad I met AZ-chan. Let's keep talking a lot! Thank you.

640
00:44:26,064 --> 00:44:30,064
いつもありがとう。こちらこそありがとう。これからも背中合わせでよろ...
Thank you always. Thank you too. Let's keep supporting each other back-to-back...

641
00:44:31,064 --> 00:44:39,064
ありがとうね、本当。温かくしてくれてありがとう。
Thank you so much, really. Thank you for making it so warm.

642
00:44:40,064 --> 00:44:43,064
はい、ということで、ありがとう。はい。
Yes, so, thank you. Yes.

643
00:44:44,064 --> 00:44:50,064
うん、坂本は？そうだよよね。忘れないでね！坂本の大事だよ！
Yeah, what about Sakamata? That's right. Don't forget! Sakamata is important too!

644
00:44:51,064 --> 00:44:59,064
じゃあ、坂本だね。実はお手紙ありますか？読ませていただきますね。
Ah, Sakamata's turn. Actually, do you have a letter? Let me read it.

645
00:45:00,427 --> 00:45:01,967
かなけんで
With Kanaken...

646
00:45:02,447 --> 00:45:07,827
何かやりたいねという始まりから、3Dライブができるまでに至るなんて、うん、思ってもいませんでした。
From wanting to do something together to actually being able to hold a 3D live, yeah, I never would've imagined it.

647
00:45:13,187 --> 00:45:16,967
そうだね。二人でマイクラをしてた時は想像もしていなかったと思います。
That's right. When we used to play Minecraft together, I never could've imagined this.

648
00:45:17,727 --> 00:45:20,667
うん。常闇は生意気な女ですが、うん？
Yeah. Tokoyami is a sassy girl, but— huh?

649
00:45:22,167 --> 00:45:31,847
とても可愛い後輩で、僕が活動のことで、辛いことがあったとき、うん、あの朝からねチャットして、LINEして、うん。
She's a very cute junior. When I had a hard time with my activities, yeah, we'd chat and line from the morning, yeah.

650
00:45:32,627 --> 00:45:36,487
ってなんかを察して、天羽は、うん、ちょっと話す？
Sensing something was up, Kanata was like, "Wanna talk for a bit?"

651
00:45:37,407 --> 00:45:43,447
って、声かけてくれて、2時間くらい喋ってくれたよね。
She reached out to me and talked with me for about two hours.

652
00:45:43,907 --> 00:45:54,747
いや、だからびっくりしてね。びっくりした、気づかれたんだと思って、本当にありましたよねと、気遣い屋さんのね、ところにいっぱい甘わせてもらいました。
I was really surprised. I thought, "She noticed," and I really leaned on her considerate nature.

653
00:45:56,047 --> 00:46:01,767
えー、常闇はしんどいときとか、寂しいときはね、僕のこの大きな胸に甘えてください。うん。
Um, Tokoyami, when times are tough or you're lonely, please lean on my big chest. Yeah.

654
00:46:03,347 --> 00:46:04,027
ま、
Well...

655
00:46:04,167 --> 00:46:07,107
ないけど、でも、ありますが、
Not really, but... well, there are times...

656
00:46:07,267 --> 00:46:16,567
ないけど、でも本当に甘えてほしいと嬉しいなって思う、そう言ってもらえたのが、このね、かなけんの期間ってね、気づいてきたことだよね。
Not really, but I'm really happy when you say you want me to lean on you. That's something I've realized during this Kanaken period.

657
00:46:17,367 --> 00:46:21,887
泣かないで！泣かないで！こんな私だけどさ、
Don't cry! Don't cry! Even though I'm like this...

658
00:46:23,847 --> 00:46:28,247
卒業まではよろしく。ずっと味方だよ。
Thanks until graduation. I'm always on your side.

659
00:46:29,447 --> 00:46:34,987
泣かないで。ありがとね。ね、お互い味方だよ。ね。
Don't cry. Thank you. We're always on each other's side.

660
00:46:36,647 --> 00:46:41,427
大丈夫の、大丈夫の、大丈夫？大丈夫！
Are you okay? Are you okay? Are you okay? I'm okay!

661
00:46:42,187 --> 00:46:48,387
と、いうことで、うふふ。うわあ、
And with that, hehe. Wow...

662
00:46:49,307 --> 00:47:02,507
実はですね、次で最後の曲に、なりますので、ラストか。ずっと歌わせて頂きたい、思いますね。ということで、はい、
Actually, the next song will be our last, so... the last one. We'd love to keep singing. So, yes...

663
00:47:03,367 --> 00:47:11,307
それでは3人でいきますか。せーの、アワーブライトパレード！
Shall the three of us go? Ready, set, Our Bright Parade!

664
00:47:32,931 --> 00:47:38,051
あれ パレード パレード 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's time to shine!

665
00:47:38,871 --> 00:47:45,411
呼び合う声を 合図に
I hear the voices calling out your name

666
00:47:46,511 --> 00:47:52,051
パレード パレード パレード 探しに行く
Parade, parade, parade! A new journey awaits

667
00:47:52,631 --> 00:47:57,991
スタートは 何度だって
Just hit reset and we can start again

668
00:48:19,564 --> 00:48:23,824
ただ 独り言 綴った
I weave lonely words into echoes

669
00:48:24,444 --> 00:48:29,164
ただ 始まりたくて 走った
I run because I heard a voice say "go!"

670
00:48:29,684 --> 00:48:33,044
遠く 暗がり に 灯った
Far away, lighting up all the darkness

671
00:48:33,484 --> 00:48:36,644
それは 眩し過ぎた 名前
It's a name, shining for us to notice

672
00:48:37,004 --> 00:48:40,524
それは 優し過ぎる 思い出もっと
Memories that fill us up with kindness and love

673
00:48:41,044 --> 00:48:45,464
近づけと 手を伸ばした 思いがけず 結び合った
You reach out and tell me to come close, every one that they called "the lost"

674
00:48:49,844 --> 00:48:51,604
ほら 今 迷子は
Here we are as "us"

675
00:48:52,164 --> 00:48:55,264
“僕等” になった
Here we are as "us"

676
00:48:55,564 --> 00:49:00,744
パレード パレード パレード 輝くんだよ
Parade, parade, parade! It's time to shine!

677
00:49:00,744 --> 00:49:05,524
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
When disappointment gets in your way, love will shine

678
00:49:05,884 --> 00:49:10,344
風 夢 羽 飛び立てるさ
Feel the wind and wishes, your wings will take you high

679
00:49:10,704 --> 00:49:16,184
ささやかな 祈りは 光 終わりなき 兆し
These silent prayers will become our light, guiding us on an endless flight

680
00:49:16,184 --> 00:49:20,524
君を 見つけたこと 胸を 張れるよ
Finally, we found each other, I can stand tall and say

681
00:49:20,964 --> 00:49:24,084
ここから これから
Starting from here, starting right now

682
00:49:24,304 --> 00:49:26,584
Our Bright Parade, Parade!

683
00:49:36,264 --> 00:49:41,024
まだ 頼りない 予感 を 歌おう
We sing, full of uncertain feelings

684
00:49:41,324 --> 00:49:46,064
恥ずかしかなんて ないよ 誰も 解決ない イマジナリー
We sing, and we're not afraid of what they think, no one can decode what we're imagining

685
00:49:46,404 --> 00:49:50,884
いつか また逢える おまじない
They don't know our magic and our destiny

686
00:49:51,024 --> 00:49:54,984
あの日 ゼロに始まった ストーリー
When we met, this was an empty story

687
00:49:55,304 --> 00:49:59,804
数え切れない 言の葉
Too many words to count them all out

688
00:50:00,100 --> 00:50:01,460
Parade, Parade, Parade!

689
00:50:01,460 --> 00:50:04,040
輝くんだよ 呼び合う声を合図に
Shining bright, taking cues from our calling voices!

690
00:50:04,140 --> 00:50:06,900
Parade, Parade, Parade! 探しに行く スタートは何度だって
Parade, Parade, Parade! No matter how many times we start anew!

691
00:50:07,239 --> 00:50:09,129
ほら 今 迷子は “僕等” になった
Look, now the lost ones have become "us."

692
00:50:11,880 --> 00:50:16,060
Parade, Parade, Parade! 美しいんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! How beautiful it is!

693
00:50:16,880 --> 00:50:19,180
許し合える 刹那 夜はきらめく
In moments of mutual forgiveness, the night sparkles.

694
00:50:19,180 --> 00:50:22,080
雨、晴れ、カレイド また とない空
Rain, shine, kaleidoscope—a once-in-a-lifetime sky!

695
00:50:22,380 --> 00:50:26,080
相応しい 旅路とは 君 と在ることさ
A fitting journey is simply being here with you.

696
00:50:26,880 --> 00:50:29,080
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わりなき 兆し
Our quiet prayers are a light, an endless omen.

697
00:50:29,080 --> 00:50:32,080
君 を見つけたこと 胸 を張れるよ
I can hold my head high knowing I found you.

698
00:50:32,380 --> 00:50:34,080
ここから これから
From here on, starting now—

699
00:50:34,580 --> 00:50:39,880
Our Bright Parade, Parade!

700
00:50:40,280 --> 00:50:46,580
まだ 頼りない予感を 歌おう 恥ずかしそう なんてないよ
Let's sing of our uncertain premonition; there's nothing to be shy about.

701
00:50:48,080 --> 00:50:50,280
誰一人解けない イマジネーション
An imagination no one can unravel,

702
00:50:50,280 --> 00:50:53,280
いつか また逢える おまじない
a spell that we will meet again someday.

703
00:50:53,880 --> 00:50:56,580
あの日 ゼロに始まった ストーリー
The story that began from zero on that day—

704
00:50:56,580 --> 00:50:59,080
数え切れない 言の葉
countless words,

705
00:50:59,080 --> 00:51:01,580
数え切れる ような 想いじゃないさ
not feelings that can be easily counted.

706
00:51:01,580 --> 00:51:04,280
ほら 今 “僕等”を 一つと呼ぼう
Look, now let's call "us" as one!

707
00:51:05,580 --> 00:51:09,580
Parade, Parade, Parade! 輝くんだよ
Parade, Parade, Parade! Shining bright!

708
00:51:09,880 --> 00:51:15,080
悔しさも 愛しさも 連れておいで
Bring your regrets and your affection along too!

709
00:51:15,280 --> 00:51:19,880
風、夢、羽 飛び立てるさ
Wind, dreams, wings—we can take flight!

710
00:51:20,580 --> 00:51:23,580
ささやかな祈りは 光 終わりなき 兆し
Our quiet prayers are a light, an endless omen.

711
00:51:23,880 --> 00:51:26,580
君 と飛び込んでいく 素敵なスタートさ
Diving in with you—what a wonderful start!

712
00:51:26,880 --> 00:51:30,080
ここから これから
From here on, starting now—

713
00:51:30,580 --> 00:51:34,080
Our Bright Parade, Parade!

714
00:51:37,580 --> 00:51:43,280
Our Bright Parade, Parade!

715
00:51:53,880 --> 00:51:57,080
ありがとう！
Thank you!

716
00:51:58,580 --> 00:52:03,080
ありがとう！
Thank you!

717
00:52:03,080 --> 00:52:14,080
ありがとうみんな！ またね！
Thank you everyone! See you again!

